cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Parmana in research or a report, please cite it as below."
title: "Parmana: policy-checked execution for AI agents, with signed, independently verifiable records"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Charak
    given-names: Pavan Dev Singh
  - name: Parmana Systems
repository-code: "https://github.com/pavancharak/parmana"
url: "https://docs.parmanasystems.com"
abstract: >-
  Parmana evaluates each action an AI agent or other system requests against a
  deterministic policy, requires a signed human approval where the policy asks
  for one, releases an approved action only through a gateway that checks a
  signed, single use authorization, and records every decision as a signed
  record that can be verified offline with only the public keys.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - authorization
  - policy enforcement
  - human approval
  - digital signatures
  - audit
